      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WHITEHAVEN BEACH (7) registered his second win from the past six runs last start when he found the lead and did well to go on and score by 2.5 metres at this track over 2190m. Won't spend a penny from this draw but luck may play a role on the bell lap. Needs to be at his best to beat this field but he good enough to play a major role. BAZZAS LEGACY (8) finished third at this track two starts back then did a good job again at his latest appearance over 2190m at the same circuit, beaten 6 metres into second after being up on the pace. Drawn to enjoy a nice run, with luck possibly playing a role at some point. Meets a similar line up so he can add to the impressive recent efforts. THE DEVIL ROLLS ON (2) must be considered after she finished third over 2190m at this track a week ago. RED HOT MIKI (5) is in the mix following a fifth at his most recent appearance over 2190m at this track.",
